          <ownedComment xmi:type="uml:Comment" xmi:id="cdif.bbr.metadata.schemaorgProperties.spatialExtent.GeoCoordinatesOrGeoShapeOrGeoShape2.geoShape.comment" xmi:uuid="f689d576-7cc8-539a-9473-abc767e02f49">
            <body>**CDIF**

Definition
==========

A schema:GeoShape bounding box. The geometry is described with a set of latitude/longitude pairs (in that order).The documentation for schema:GeoShape states 'Either whitespace or commas can be used to separate latitude and longitude; whitespace should be used when writing a list of several such points.'</body>
            <annotatedElement xmi:idref="cdif.bbr.metadata.schemaorgProperties.spatialExtent.GeoCoordinatesOrGeoShapeOrGeoShape2.geoShape"/>
          </ownedComment>
        </ownedAttribute>
